  << /ActualText (Contributed to the development and launch of a customer\055facing React Native application\054 taking the product from MVP through to production\056\n\nKey Contributions\072\nDeveloped core application features using React Native\054 contributing from initial implementation through to production release\056\nIntroduced and led the development of a shared design system\054 establishing reusable components and consistent UI patterns across the application\056\nContributed to application architecture and technical decisions as the product moved beyond its MVP\056\nWorked closely with product designers to translate designs and requirements into working application features\056\nReviewed code\054 contributed to technical planning\054 and supported the application\047s production release\056)
